<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-10-24T07:29:10.368Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:29:10 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gangs clashed inside two Ecuadorian prisons, killing eight inmates and wounding ten others. The government responded with increased security measures and preventive detention of former candidate Luisa González on alleged money-laundering charges. Political repression and militarization have intensified as President Noboa aligns the country with external security interests. The crisis recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPYnNWWF9IMnVLc0tPYy1iT2xfbFE1cElNMnMxcWNsWUV2VUhabFo1VDFLUERtX2xnd1A4VS1ZSDdNbDdnRzdaYnlhY3Vqb19PQWpxd29PVDVVLXVwUVBfbGlrUFBBX2htOTB6NDFSbzNNYXg4WVlfLTZFdm8wb2JNWXlXZ3JfMWZMeUNIaDFsMlpkeUVQa2ZBb1lHTTN6YzlZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Wonderwall&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNb1JFS3I2ZDZ5VjNiOXhoTFBfZnIzeU1EdVlVbFpfM0gtbTFscEtzMlhSeVU3QXdkNDJGclZTV3Y2TThmNkU3VU1TbEtuZFd2Ynh2eHd3QllBckpVNWU2dDVqRjJ6Z1V5MGt5QTdjVmE2TS1mVkozS2ZBLU5KckFmV2RRMm4zTU05X0xJS2R1NF94Ulg5LW5PYlYyXzU0NVNZVVFremJwa1EwOHJQZk1zTzhn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQT3Q2bG1WM3VpYkh4WXhRUi1HWGR6X1FGNjNyRjhQQnBmS1RDdlFHUkJLTG5jeGw3WVg1ZGZOa1psOUppZWh4alpkeFZLbkJXVTlILTRxekw5RE1Uai1vX0VxU2pTMGlYREZUMlQ3dVh0VFoweEVzWXQ2OXp5QktPMW5MNFdHTnljaUZTRWlLUkZGX2k0cDlUVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;İlke Haber Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTFBtcWNicDJCVHM2cUk3MTJQR19UVEx4UFpRMGktZmxRRzB3b3oxMWhZUl9Ca2UwWFRKbXppbGJaazFxbzRGeGRnUjhWZVljZ0JsUVU2QlBoejc0a2YzcWxlOHNxV01GcGdoRjlFRTZTN2ZKTDhmSzlxdE9uTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Big News Network.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&qu